    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your operation needed in the gameplay is inputting any numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character head to a certain door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along that way, other monsters approaches him and one-sidedly start a game with number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other monsters is going to makes him an easy target. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character has no way of explaining the game rules to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needed observation and consideration for inputting any advantageous number and win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest version contains 7 levels: 5 normal levels, 1 hidden level, and 1 special level where a hidden monster is in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 2 minutes from starting the first level to reaching the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I recommend trying the demo version before you buy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I hope you choose games you can really love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Download Demo&quot; button is on the right part of this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 normal levels only in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The save progress feature is not available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemy monsters of the demo version have different status values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding guidelines for sharing gameplay videos of this game on social media</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I prepared guidelines. Please refer it from the Q&amp;A page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Q&amp;A page is in an external site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the &quot;View the manual&quot; link button on right side of this page to view the Q&amp;A page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice: I apologize that the Japanese version of guidelines is only available currently.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your operation needed in the gameplay is inputting any numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character head to a certain door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along that way, other monsters approaches him and one-sidedly start a game with number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other monsters is going to makes him an easy target. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character has no way of explaining the game rules to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needed observation and consideration for inputting any advantageous number and win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest version contains 7 levels: 5 normal levels, 1 hidden level, and 1 special level where a hidden monster is in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 2 minutes from starting the first level to reaching the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I recommend trying the demo version before you buy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I hope you choose games you can really love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Download Demo&quot; button is on the right part of this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 normal levels only in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The save progress feature is not available in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemy monsters of the demo version have different status values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding guidelines for sharing gameplay videos of this game on social media</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I prepared guidelines. Please refer it from the Q&amp;A page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Q&amp;A page is in an external site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the &quot;View the manual&quot; link button on right side of this page to view the Q&amp;A page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice: I apologize that the Japanese version of guidelines is only available currently.</p>",
